  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Increases Shine</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dryness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ All Hair Types</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A delicious hair perfume that’s infused with Mirsalehi Honey to add shine and instantly scent hair with notes of creamy vanilla, milk, and musk.<br><br><b>Hair Texture:</b> Straight, Wavy, Curly, and Coily<br><br><b>Hair Type:</b> Fine, Medium, and Thick<br><br><b>Hair Concerns:<br></b>- Shine<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></b>- Mirsalehi Honey: Maintains a natural moisture balance for strong, shiny, and healthy hair.<br>- Argan Oil: Nourishes, hydrates, and adds healthy shine.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This scent evokes the cozy indulgence of fall. Notes of milk and creamy vanilla are blended with powdery musk to create a sweet and enveloping fragrance. It&rsquo</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Spray, shake, shine.<br>-Divide hair into sections and spray evenly from an arm&rsquo;s length distance throughout the hair.<br>-Give your hair a flip to diffuse the irresistible Wildflower Honey scent.<br>-Hair is refreshed and has a glossy shine.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Mirsalehi Honey: Maintains a natural moisture balance for strong, shiny, and healthy hair.<br>-Argan Oil: Nourishes, hydrates, and adds healthy shine.<br><br>Alcohol Denat., Aqua (Water, Eau), Parfum (Fragrance), PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Mel (Honey, Miel)*, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Sodium Benzotriazolyl Butylphenol Sulfonate, Tris(Tetramethylhydroxypiperidinol) Citrate, Acetyl Cedrene**, Coumarin**, Rose Ketones**, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes**, Vanillin**, CI 19140 (Yellow 5), CI 14700 (Red 4).<br><br>*Honey sourced from the Mirsalehi Bee Garden <br>**Allergens<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
